‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SSkjhyIC0XgrGoGdbtEoz1tgq2KQjE4EJicndX6j9uJgiaRE5ZibwglWOUPypPEX0lmYV0X8AntAlQA/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"white-space: normal;width: 474px;height: 469px;\"/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n            关于 唐梅奥\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span>\n           唐梅奥是一个咖啡家族生意，旗下目前有14个农场，分布在三个大区；自从2008年以来，家族下不同的农场在哥斯达黎加的CoE赛事里不断的崭露头角；\n          </span>\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n             ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RMTibjWG0bXEAdmSgNicicScuG7q0UmvlmBRy2kYF3yOnCZcJboGYfbNF4tg4hYvbxlO613WZStHqLw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           唐梅奥目前在哥斯达黎加共有14个庄园如下：\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SSkjhyIC0XgrGoGdbtEoz1aAJtHXfeySo4OTtxV3dpBjyptFTQXUicrhMQOmc6DLqnrBfgymga27w/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n           关于王牌地块 Los Tucanes\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           王牌地块的特色在于，它坐拥太平洋和整个克波斯山谷的壮丽景色，面前便是令人惊叹的龙峰（Cerro el Dragon）和阿瓜卡特山（Montes del Aguacate），这里划分并种植了四种不同的咖啡品种，该农场于8年前收购，当时还没有咖啡树，只是一片牧场；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           处理方式：\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           为了确保处理顺利进行，庄园只收获完全成熟的咖啡果。咖啡果送入处理站后进行去皮，将所有的果胶保留下来进行干燥；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           庄园生产的每个批次都会在处理完成时进行一次杯测，静置至少40天再进行一次杯测。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\n            关于拉诺地块 El Lliano\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           拉诺地块对唐梅奥家族来说意义非凡，因为它是家族世世代代，获取生活必需品的地方。赫克托·博尼利亚（Héctor Bonilla）的童年就在这里度过，他们也在这里种植玉米、豆类、咖啡、甘蔗以及他们所需的一切食物；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           目前，这里种植咖啡品种包括：卡杜艾、波旁、瑰夏 和薇拉莎奇，种植区域按品种划分明确；由于其独特的朝向，这里几乎全天都能接受阳光照射，肥沃的沙质火山土壤、适宜的气候以及海拔 1850 米以上的高度，造就了出产的高品质咖啡，并深受顾客的认可和好评。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           处理方式：\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           为了确保处理顺利进行，庄园只收获完全成熟的咖啡果；鲜果经过采收和清理后，被放在温室的非洲高架晒床日晒23天。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\n            哥斯达黎加CoE赛事获奖记录\n           </span>\n           ：\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           2008\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n             Cup of Excellence, La Loma 3th place\n            </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           2009\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-